US\">(KORAIL)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">에서는 대학생들이 열차를 이용하여 전국 각지를 여행할 수 있는 자유이용패스권</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">『</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">내일로 티켓</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 판매하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">특별히</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가평역에서는</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">내일로 티켓</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">발권자</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가평역혜택지정</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">에게 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">남이섬 입장권등 다양한 사은품</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(10</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가지</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 제공</span></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">하오니 관심있는 학생들이</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">내일로 티켓</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">을 이용한 철도 여행과 다양한 사은품 혜택을 동시에 누릴 수 있도록 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 487pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 156pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">내일로 티켓 이용 안내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 17pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">운영기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">하계 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 1